    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d153-a1">

                <pb facs="0307" n="251" sameAs="frus:frus1876/pg251"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 104.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Lord Derby to Mr.
                            Hoffman</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Foreign Office</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1876-05-31"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 31,
                        1876</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: With reference to my note of the 24th
                    instant, I have the honor to inform you that the hearing of the application for
                    the release of Winslow has been finally adjourned until the 15th proximo.</p>
                <p>I have, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>DERBY.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
